msgid "When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default."
msgstr "Gaž se we Babilim něco njezgótowa, pósćel rozpšawu wó zmylku k słužbje Babilim, aby se mógła ako zjawne pśipowěsćenje na GitHub wózjawiś. Rozpšawa se pósćele, ako by pśišła z toś togo sedła, ze samskeju awtentifikaciju ako kužde druge napšašowanje k słužbje Babilim. Słužba wózjawi jano kod zmylka a wersije ako zjawne pśipowěsćenje na GitHub; zjawne pśipowěsćenje njewopśimjejo adresu sedła, wopśimjeśe ani datajowe puśe. Standard: wušaltowane."

